<title>HUNGARY: Budapest stock exchange publishes 1996 figures.</title>
<headline>Budapest stock exchange publishes 1996 figures.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Budapest Stock Exchange (BSE) published 1996 turnover, capitalisation and other figures on Wednesday.</p>
